D":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"研究对象：野狼，基本健康\n食用针蝗后极度饥饿，大量进食倾向。死因：饥饿，营养不良。\n全身状况：消瘦，脱毛，肌肉萎缩，极度虚弱，腹痛。\n解剖所见：胃部少量食物残渣残留；黏膜异常充血；肠部见血斑。大量切片组织见含非自然物质，与针蝗解剖物质高度相似。\n“诅咒”是某种力量的集合？针蝗大量携带，逸散到土地、空气、水源？传播方式未知。雅库伯尔未受影响的原因？\n\n研究对象：男，中年，长期饥饿，身形消瘦。死因：营养不良。\n……\n解剖所见：胃部少量食物残渣残留；大量切片组织见含非自然物质\n非自然物质似乎来源于诅咒。诅咒的来源是神力？\n用魔法对抗神力？下一步研究：如何逆转诅咒影响——题目是梅林起的。","textdes_id":"339","document_page_count":"2","document_title_cn":"解剖记录（其一）","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"1005095","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item5.png","document_image_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item5.png","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item5.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:1:1536004001:1":{"key":"say:1:1536004001:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"1","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1536004001","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不得不说，摩根虽然外表懒懒的，但对待研究的态度确实很认真。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:2:1536004002:1":{"key":"say:2:1536004002:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1536004002","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不过，或许是因为不能去雅库伯尔研究的原因，摩根的推论中...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:3:1536004003:1":{"key":"say:3:1536004003:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1536004003","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"或许你可以用<style=highlight>留言</...","